{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03425","headline":"奉和春日幸望春宫 · 崔湜","name":"奉和春日幸望春宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"澹荡春光满晓空，逍遥御辇入离宫。\n山河眺望云天外，台榭参差烟雾中。\n庭际花飞锦绣合，枝间鸟啭管弦同。\n即此欢娱齐镐宴，唯应率舞乐薰风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}